sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant KDC as KDC (Domain Controller)
    participant Service

    Client->>KDC: AS-REQ
    KDC-->>Client: AS-REP with TGT (4768)
    Client->>KDC: TGS-REQ using TGT
    KDC-->>Client: TGS-REP w/ service ticket (4769)
    Client->>Service: AP-REQ, presents ticket
    Note over Service: Grants access if valid
